# Raft Row Bazaar (CIPlay raft_row_bazaar): the market, the price board, the engine stall (motor wheel), the shortage
# list, the Fleet's stall (steering wheel; the plan's fleet rule goes by this step), the back room locked until the
# drawer's key, the ledger, a hen for the Fleet, Crane's broadcast, the pedlar's tram, the climb, a friend's note.
# offset 0 0 is a placeholder: phase 2 sets it from the recipe's save log (PLAY_FORMAT: Coordinates).
island Raft Row Bazaar
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Prices Without Rules
zone market
expect step 1
read Bazaar price board
expect step 2
open Engine stall crate
wait 3
expect step 3
read Shortage list
expect step 4
zone fleet_stall
expect step 5
open Free Fleet stall
wait 3
expect step 6
read Complaint No. 230
expect step 7
expect hidden rb_broadcast
use rb_speaker
expect shown rb_broadcast
read Councillor's broadcast
expect step 8
open Back room
expect story backkey 0
expect step 8
open Merchant's drawer
expect story backkey 1
open Back room
wait 3
expect step 9
read Withheld stock ledger
expect step 10
catch Chicken 1
expect step 11
read Fire warden's report
expect step 12
expect hidden rb_rewchest
use rb_machine
expect hidden rb_rewchest
read Market crier's notice
expect step 13
zone rubbish_hill
expect step 14
open Pedlar's caravan
wait 3
expect step 15
read Pedlar's tag
expect step 16
zone pedlars_cave
open Pedlars' stock
wait 3
expect story rb_deep 1
expect step 17
# STORY 10-24: the climb last; the sunk arcade is an optional dive now
zone rb_trail
expect step 18
openat -55.78 58.48
zone rb_summit
expect step 19
expect stand -49.07 57.2 h=30
open Pedlars' bell tower deck box
wait 3
expect story rb_top 1
expect step 20
use rb_machine
expect shown rb_rewchest
expect story rb_fixed 1
open Crier's box reward
wait 3
read Crier's ledger
expect step 21
code rb_strongpad 1111 wrong
expect hidden rb_strongchest
expect hidden rb_friendnote
code rb_strongpad 8523
expect shown rb_strongchest
expect shown rb_friendnote
expect story rb_strong 1
expect step 22
open Crier's strongbox
wait 3
read Merchant's warning
expect step 23
read A friend's note
expect done
